OL,3,GNEWSAFestive season to get under way in
OL,4,AHull city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour days of activities including a
OL,7,FChristmas market and live entertainment
OL,8,Fwill be held in Hull city centre this
OL,9,Fweek to get people in the festive
OL,10,Fspirit.
OL,12,FThe Festival of Christmas will start on
OL,13,FThursday with the lights switch-on in
OL,14,FQueen Victoria Square and King Edward
OL,15,FStreet, alongside a small market. The
OL,16,Fswitch-on is expected to be at about
OL,17,F18:45 GMT.
OL,19,FThere will be a young traders market on
OL,20,FFriday on King Edward Street, with
OL,21,Flocal makers selling gifts, crafts and
OL,22,Ffood.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
