OL,3,GNEWSAFestive season to get under way in
OL,4,AHull city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will also be a weekend of festive
OL,7,Factivities on Saturday and Sunday,
OL,8,Fincluding a market, funfair rides, food
OL,9,Fand live music.
